% p21_num_conv_equal -- discriminates the CONVERSION case: two numerals are
% convertible iff their VALUES are equal. The two `7`s are distinct nodes
% (sharing is forbidden), so accepting this requires comparing values, not ids.
0 sort 0
axiom I64 : 0
numtype I64
1 const I64
2 sort 0
3 pi 1 2
axiom P : 3
4 const P
5 num 7
6 app 4 5
axiom pf : 6
7 const pf
8 const P
9 num 7
10 app 8 9
check 7 : 10
